      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Let's just say I made a bit of a bet with Harry. If I could kill the Mandalorians and bring back their dog tags he'd owe me drinks for a month. This way I don't need to get my hands dirty and I can still get my free drinks. It's a win-win situation, if you ask me.",
